    "clinicalPearl": "Key takeaway: HL survivors irradiated to chest before age 30 → ANNUAL BREAST MRI + MAMMOGRAPHY starting 8-10 yrs after radiation OR at age 30. Also screen: cardiovascular disease, thyroid dysfunction (TSH), secondary malignancies (lung, sarcoma, leukemia).",
