    "clinicalPearl": "Key takeaway: HCL-VARIANT = BRAF V600E NEGATIVE + CD25 NEGATIVE + often MAP2K1 mutant. Less responsive to cladribine alone. Treat with PURINE ANALOG + RITUXIMAB. Relapsed: moxetumomab, MEK inhibitors for MAP2K1, venetoclax, BTK inhibitors.",
